            <div xml:id="d589">

                <pb facs="0558" n="546" sameAs="frus:frus1944v05/pg546"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.52/458: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé at Tangier</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Elbrick</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-05-11T19:00:00-04:00">May 11, 1944—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>64. Although the Department is taking up with Madrid the subject matter of your
                    telegram No. 107, May 8, 7 p.m., no objection is perceived to your seeing
                    Orgaz.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
